// =============================================================================
// Query:        Failed RDP Logons (Brute Force Detection)
// Data source:  SecurityEvent (Windows Security Events via AMA)
// Platform:     Microsoft Sentinel
// Purpose:      Surface Event ID 4625 (failed logon) spikes against the
//               honeypot VM, generated by the Hydra RDP brute-force attack.
// Result:       87 failed logon attempts for the local account "azureadmin"
//               within a short window -> classic brute-force signature.
// =============================================================================
SecurityEvent
| where EventID == 4625
| order by TimeGenerated desc
